"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"中文：[open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:15
#: 4a3e3ce400b44926850565f64cffb3cf
msgid ""
