#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:18
#: 75d08c11e0494e039a9501cdccd9a87a
msgid "Clone and init"
msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:20
#: f297e1bd1a074b8098ccce57e2db04c4
msgid "From the README (directory name `lift2s-ws` is the example):"
msgstr "来自 README（目录名 `lift2s-ws` 为示例）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:22
#: 5c26cc611c744701bd3b05b3577b7519
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:29
#: abcbe7845a624dfd8c1edb18726444fe
msgid ""
"Field zip (README): unzip, then `./release.sh --install`, then "
"`./quick_start.sh`. Descriptions stay as source; controllers / hardware "
"interface come from `.deb`."
msgstr ""
"现场 zip（README）：解压后执行 `./release.sh --install`，再执行 "
"`./quick_start.sh`。描述保持源码；控制器 / 硬件接口来自 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:31
#: 700776f9e22c4326aa8349067b479d6d
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:33
#: 7315f6aa2a5649d99883b1234bef3610
msgid ""
"Primary path is `./quick_start.sh` (scenario build + Lift2S split/full "
"body, simulation or real):"
msgstr "主路径是 `./quick_start.sh`（按场景编译 + Lift2S 分身/全身，仿真或真机）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:35
#: 68bda89789194847a3bc0f4396c0c580
msgid ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:40
#: b2cad95eddca4d85a195757fed46e821
msgid "README menu:"
msgstr "README 菜单："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:42
#: 86c6e6bff83140f7b92be948040e20fd
msgid ""
"**Build** — simulation packages, or real-hardware packages (includes "
"`arx_ros2_control`)"
msgstr "**编译** — 仿真软件包，或真机软件包（含 `arx_ros2_control`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:43
#: f007b23f897648938b056df795cc393a
msgid ""
"**Launch** — choose **Lift2S**, then **split body** (分体控制) or **full "
"body** (全身控制), then simulation (`mock_components`) or **real hardware**. "
"See [分体控制 vs 全身控制](../../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)."
msgstr ""
"**启动** — 选择 **Lift2S**，再选 **分体控制** 或 **全身控制**，然后仿真（`mock_components`）或 **真机**。见 [分体控制 vs 全身控制](../../../3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:45
#: e28615a8cf8d40e09a9105d89155297d
msgid ""
"CAN (README): left/right arms `can1` / `can3`; no network IP. Lift axis "
"defaults to `hybrid` (change to `soft_p` in `quick_start`)."
msgstr ""
"CAN（README）：左右臂 `can1` / `can3`；没有网络 IP。升降轴默认 `hybrid`（可在 `quick_start` "
"中改为 `soft_p`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:47
#: 586c3aa691294eeb8c70617a7e359677
msgid ""
"X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S in the same menu are `robot-"
"descriptions-arx` models for **co-debug**. Pick **ACone** only when you "
"want the **arm**, not the full Lift 2S chassis."
msgstr ""
"同一菜单中的 X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S 是用于 **联调** 的 `robot-descriptions-"
"arx` 模型。只有在需要 **机械臂**、而不是完整 Lift 2S 底盘时才选 **ACone**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:49
#: 305a53689d584b4284b73b785facc9b5
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:51
#: f5e2156a6b6945d0949dcd42189a0166
msgid ""
"Prefer the script. These are the README’s optional equivalents for "
"**Lift2S**:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。以下是 README 中 **Lift2S** 的可选等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:53
#: 7c5153a73178499391249bc39351b9ad
msgid ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"
msgstr ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:62
#: a308f83417914961b0ace870dddf38f1
msgid ""
"Those OCS2 launches also take `type` / `left_type` / `right_type` from "
"[robot_common_launch](../../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md) "
"(`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`). Different L/R: `left_type:=`"
" and `right_type:=` together; **do not pass `type:=`** then. "
"Visualization `manipulator.launch.py` uses the same first-class args."
msgstr ""
"这些 OCS2 launch 也接收 [robot_common_launch](../../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md) 的 `type` / `left_type` / `right_type`（`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`）。左右不同：同时传 `left_type:=` 与 `right_type:=`；此时**不要再传 `type:=`**。可视化 `manipulator.launch.py` 使用同一套一等参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:64
#: f7653b074df04c01bc12ce59603cd0e4
msgid ""
"Zenoh: README asks for `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` on the deploy host."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：README 要求在部署主机上执行 `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 并 "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`。"

